{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜螞蟻國際聯同中銀滙豐等完成通證化存款交易 跨行支付五分鐘到賬           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">螞蟻國際透過金管局的EnsembleTX通證化存款機制，於2026年9月至10月與中銀香港、建行亞洲及滙豐完成連串港幣跨行真實交易，支付指令發出至最終收款全程於五分鐘內辦妥，實現即時到賬及24小時流動資金調撥，減少企業預先調撥資金的需要。該公司同時推出「智能體財資管理」，配合全棧AI原生產品方案，覆蓋AI外匯及資金管理等場景。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:38.932437+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:00:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:39:13.438766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:39:13.438766+00:00","content_hash":"02786253b2c21a21ee8d9956808cf3018f6c211650830eaec45267723305e174","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}